      "description": "Close = last price of each 5-minute window (FR-10), plotted at the window end. Markers: \u25b2 BUY / \u25bc SELL advisories. Shaded: EMA warm-up, until the initial EMA = 0 (FR-12) weighs below 1% (88 windows for EMA38, 231 for EMA100). The y-axis follows the closes, so EMAs rising from 0 start below the chart. Lines break where the symbol has no window for more than 30 minutes (nights, weekend).",
      "gridPos": {
